  "title": "Xerox Holdings Corporation Declares Dividend on Common and Preferred Stock",
  "summary": "Xerox Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: XRX) announced today that its board of directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.025 per share on Xerox Holdings Corporation Common Stock. The dividend is payable on October 30, 2026, to shareholders of record on September 30, 2026.",
